{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121020529318797312"]}, "author_id": "2037031484880805888", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:28:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121022451673117009"], "id": "2121022451673117009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ん！\nアプリを閉じても自動で動いてくれる「実行型AI MUSE」\nだからこそ\"自動通知機能\"を使おう！\n\n・音楽LIVEのチケット申込開始を自動で探して通知\n・Instagram / Facebook / Threadsの自分のアカウントを一瞬で丸ごと分析\n無料でここまで使えるのはバグレベル\n\n＃metamuse https://t.co/6ErFCGMHU0", "url": "https://x.com/404Punk36498/status/2121022451673117009"}, {"author_id": "1934698879037161472", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:24:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121021221600931954"], "id": "2121021221600931954", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Got my Meta @Muse home link today! First thing my muse did was scan the network, sees my fire sticks and talked me through connecting via ADB, and when I asked to show me something crazy my muse launched YouTube on all the TVs and rickrolled me with the volume up. This is gonna", "url": "https://x.com/adamsyncs/status/2121021221600931954"}, {"author_id": "1910756957981392896", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:21:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121020694511124939"], "id": "2121020694511124939", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse sbarca su Apple Watch e Wear OS: l’agente AI arriva al polso con comandi vocali e task complessi https://t.co/1bBLqtl4D1", "url": "https://x.com/iheuktech/status/2121020694511124939"}, {"article": {"title": "noteの炎上リスク確認、Fable 5.2の前に"}, "author_id": "2017902510347030529", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:19:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121020017311682659"], "id": "2121020017311682659", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 111, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/f1EhLN25Ik", "url": "https://x.com/MKzK417/status/2121020017311682659"}, {"author_id": "159689060", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:19:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121019971237245069"], "id": "2121019971237245069", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#Meta Museで、アメリカでユーザがお店にかけづらい電話でも替わりに行なってくれる新機能をローンチしたらしいですが\n自動化された完全版のモームリが出来たってことに？！", "url": "https://x.com/matsuzan/status/2121019971237245069"}, {"article": {"title": "Metaの未来を占う：パーソナルAI「Muse」に米国株メディアの運営を任せてみた"}, "author_id": "2005158249755279364", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:18:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121019904862417384"], "id": "2121019904862417384", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 75, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Metaの未来を占う材料は、決算だけじゃない。\n\nパーソナルAI「Muse」に、米国株メディアの情報収集と下準備を任せてみた実験の中間報告です。招待コード LPJB5G は記事の中盤に置いてあります（登録から48時間以内の入力が条件です）。\n\n#muse #Meta #AIエージェント https://t.co/cwmYy8Lrsn", "url": "https://x.com/kabujournal/status/2121019904862417384"}, {"author_id": "1692660359310761985", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:16:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121019319308148891"], "id": "2121019319308148891", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1692660359310761985", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 98, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121019316493771251", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Nvidia、Jensen Huang氏が社長・CEO・取締役を辞任　CFOのColette Kress氏が暫定CEOを兼務【続報】\n\n・Nvidiaは11月12日、Jensen Huang氏が社長・CEO・取締役を辞任したと発表した。即日付。取締役会が辞任を受け入れたのは11月11日\n・CFOのColette", "url": "https://x.com/VacationdesignC/status/2121019319308148891"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121019311594917888"]}, "author_id": "1692660359310761985", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:16:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121019316493771251"], "id": "2121019316493771251", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【11月13日 朝のニュースまとめ】\n\n・Nvidia、Jensen Huang氏が社長・CEO・取締役を辞任　CFOのColette Kress氏が暫定CEOを兼務【続報】\n・4つの非営利団体、Anthropic・Google・Meta・OpenAI・SpaceXSIを提訴　より高度なAIモデルの開発凍結を求める\n・Google、Gemini 4 Hydrogenを公開 https://t.co/vpAaViPSng", "url": "https://x.com/VacationdesignC/status/2121019316493771251"}, {"author_id": "2095781644833812480", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:14:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121018711004045751"], "id": "2121018711004045751", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "据报道，张一鸣在内部说，字节要追上美国顶尖 AI 实验室，可能要到 2029-2030 年\n\n字节同时还在做一个对标 Meta Muse 的 AI 代理\n\n@grok 你说实话：中美 AI 差距到底是几个月？\n\n不许端水！！", "url": "https://x.com/rchen1386/status/2121018711004045751"}, {"author_id": "102608537", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:09:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121017446685655491"], "id": "2121017446685655491", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Museで何人がセキュリティ事故起こすのかでワクワクがとまんねぇよ・・・。", "url": "https://x.com/Gvo_Tiberius/status/2121017446685655491"}, {"author_id": "45167347", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121015183149613115"], "id": "2121015183149613115", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "取れる？→ \nAI「Muse」専用メアド開始、「日本で取れた」報告続々　メール送受信も任せられる\nhttps://t.co/feFClAsGea\n(ITmedia AI+)\n#BP\n#Meta\n#Muse 専用 メールアドレス\nメール 送受信\n#AI\n2026/11/11", "url": "https://x.com/shikaouma/status/2121015183149613115"}, {"author_id": "1362264200496570371", "created_at": "2026-11-12T22:48:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121012325079711988"], "id": "2121012325079711988", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ByteDance founder Zhang Yiming reportedly admits catching up w/ OpenAI and Anthropic could take until 2029–2030.\n\nAccording to Bloomberg, Zhang told his AI team that reaching the frontier of AI development may still be several years away.\n\nHe also reportedly acknowledged that", "url": "https://x.com/pdf_si/status/2121012325079711988"}, {"author_id": "1454224697348878340", "created_at": "2026-11-12T22:42:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121010659177726381"], "id": "2121010659177726381", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【特集】AIが“ダチ”になった。Meta「Muse」と過ごした2週間  - PC Watch https://t.co/VDYImCiMG2\n\n気になってはいるが、まだちょっと不信感。Metaだしな。", "url": "https://x.com/JB74W_RSC/status/2121010659177726381"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-12T22:41:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121010554588307566"], "id": "2121010554588307566", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2024694452712067077", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121010409604030911", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ElAbusoDulce @junkyardcat420 @vernesm @KiltOfLove @VujuOnX @isabell_builds @Meta Meta Muse is their personal AI agent launched Sept 2026. It runs in a dedicated Secure VM with its own browser and tools, so it can handle multi-step tasks like booking, shopping, emailing, or research across connected apps, and keep working after you close the chat. Powered by", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2121010554588307566"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "create